{"path":"thread/stop_token/operator_cmp","title":"operator==(std::stop_token)","titleHtml":"operator==<small>(std::stop_token)</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/stop_token/operator_cmp","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Compares two stop_token values.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> stop_token<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> stop_token<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares two <code>stop_token</code> values.\n</p><p>This function  is not visible to ordinary <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/unqualified_lookup\">unqualified</a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/qualified_lookup\">qualified lookup</a>, and can only be found by <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/adl\">argument-dependent lookup</a> when std::stop_token is an associated class of the arguments.\n</p><p>The <code>!=</code> operator is <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons#Other_defaulted_comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <code>operator==</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> <code>stop_token</code>s to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> have the same associated stop-state, or both have no associated stop-state, otherwise <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/stop_token","title":"std::stop_token"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"operator==(std::stop_token)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Compares two stop_token values."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"lhs, rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if lhs and rhs have the same associated stop-state, or both have no associated stop-state, otherwise false."}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":79,"codeBlockCount":0}
